{"code":2000,"codename":"Koyuki","data":{"id":561,"skin":"","skin_jp":"","skin_cn":"","skin_zh_tw":"","skin_list":[{"id":561,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/Student_Portrait_CH0319_Collection.png","skin":"","skin_cn":""}],"family_name":"薄叶","given_name":"律","family_name_jp":"薄葉","given_name_jp":"リツ","family_name_kr":"우스바","given_name_kr":"리츠","family_name_en":"Usuba","given_name_en":"Ritsu","family_name_zh_tw":"","given_name_zh_tw":"","family_name_cn":"","given_name_cn":"","nick_name":"","momo_talk_signature":"哪里有带条纹的大理石——！","main_relation":143,"relation":null,"age":15,"grade":"一年生","height":140,"birthday":"03-06","hobby":"走私、采石","designer":"Paruru","illustrator":"Paruru","character_voice":"濑户桃子","character_voice_cn":"","release_date":"2025-10-08","release_date_cn":null,"release_date_global":null,"school":14,"weapon_type":"SMG","is_install":true,"is_install_cn":false,"is_install_global":false,"is_npc":false,"show_list":true,"body_shape":"Small","special_appearance":false,"spine":[1172,1175],"model":[471,474],"voice":[{"description":"ch0319_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"可以把作品放在那边嘛~？","text_original":"あのへんに作品置けるかな～？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"这个地方，能再改善一下通风吗~？啊！……那里，应该可以打个洞！","text_original":"ここ、もうちょっと風通しよくならないかな～？あ！……あそこ、穴あけられるかも！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"咖啡的香气……有办法表现出来吗。","text_original":"コーヒーのいい匂い……表現できないかなぁ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"嗯…下一次要进的货……","text_original":"うーん、次の輸入品は～っと……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"要是把这里的蛋糕带回去的话……学院里的大家也会很开心吧！","text_original":"ここのケーキを持って帰ったら……きっと、学院のみんなも喜んでくれるよね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_cafe_monolog_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"嘿呀！","text_original":"えいやっ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_commonskill.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_eventlobby_1","category":"event","text":"嗯，老师？我的脸上，沾了什么粉末吗？","text_original":"ん、先生？ボクの顔、粉でもついてる？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_eventlobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_eventlobby_2","category":"event","text":"啊哈！啊哈哈！真是的！你这样一直戳我的话……吃我反击！","text_original":"あは！あははっ！も～！そんなにつっつくなら……お返しだ～っ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_eventlobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_eventlobby_3","category":"event","text":"大，大家，别这么消沉嘛~……。","text_original":"み、みんな、どんよりしないで～……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_eventlobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_eventlobby_4","category":"event","text":"不论遇到什么困难都没问题！特殊交易部……总能找到门路的！","text_original":"どんなピンチでも大丈夫！特殊交易部は……いつだって、抜け道を見つけ出すんだよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_eventlobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_eventlogin_1","category":"event","text":"老师！这边这边~！","text_original":"先生！こっちこっち～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_eventlogin_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_eventlogin_2","category":"event","text":"事情好像乱成一团了呢……算了，尽力去做吧！","text_original":"なんだか話がごちゃごちゃしちゃってるね……ま、やるだけやってみるよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_eventlogin_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_eventlogin_season_1","category":"event","text":"还是头一次接到这种委托……既然是美代酱制定的作战，肯定没问题的！","text_original":"こういう依頼は初めてだけど……ミヨちゃんの作戦なら、きっと大丈夫！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_eventlogin_season_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_eventlogin_season_2","category":"event","text":"这次的委托……感觉还挺有意思的？","text_original":"今回の依頼……割と面白いかも？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_eventlogin_season_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_eventlogin_season_end","category":"event","text":"哈~结束啦结束啦~……嗯？大家怎么没精打采的？","text_original":"ひゃあ～終わった終わった～……あれ？みんなヘロヘロ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_eventlogin_season_end.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_eventmission_1","category":"event","text":"嗯？怎么了？","text_original":"うん？どしたの？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_eventmission_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_eventmission_2","category":"event","text":"虽然很麻烦，但是很开心？欸嘿嘿，我也一样呢！","text_original":"大変だったけど、楽しかった？えへへ、ボクと一緒だねっ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_eventmission_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_eventmission_day_end","category":"event","text":"今天已经关门了。明天见咯！","text_original":"今日はもう扉閉めちゃったんだ。また明日ね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_eventmission_day_end.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_eventmission_get_1","category":"event","text":"好厉~害！老师，你什么事情都会呢~！","text_original":"すっご～い！先生、なんでもできるんだね～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_eventmission_get_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_eventmission_get_2","category":"event","text":"可不能忘了奖励哦~","text_original":"ご褒美は忘れちゃダメだよ～","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_eventmission_get_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_eventmission_login_1","category":"event","text":"好多有意思的事情呢！嘿嘿，老师就敬请期待吧！","text_original":"楽しいことがいっぱいだよ～！へへ、期待しててね先生！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_eventmission_login_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_eventmission_login_2","category":"event","text":"虽然有难事，但没有不可能的事！","text_original":"難しいことはあっても、不可能はな～い！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_eventmission_login_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"哼哼，有个正合适的呢~♪","text_original":"ふふっ、ちょうどいいのがあるんだ～♪","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_exskill_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"拿来了很棒的东西哦！","text_original":"すっごいの、持ってきたよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_exskill_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"应该就在这一块……！","text_original":"たしかこの辺に……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_exskill_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"嗯，吃了这个！鼓起干劲吧~！","text_original":"はい、これ食べて！張り切ってこ～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_exskill_level_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"打起精神！冲啊——！","text_original":"元気出して！えいえいおー！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_exskill_level_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"看，还能行吧！","text_original":"ほら、まだいけるよね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_exskill_level_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"哇！我一直都很想要这个！谢谢你，老师！我很高兴！","text_original":"わぁ！これ、ずーっと欲しかったんだ！ありがとね、先生！うれしい！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_exweapon_get.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"怎么怎么~？要做什么吗~？","text_original":"なになに～？なんかやるの～？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_formation_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"好像很有意思！我也要掺进去试试！","text_original":"おもしろそう！ボクも混ぜてよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_formation_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_formation_select","category":"formation","text":"哼哼~♪……啊，是老师！","text_original":"ふんふふ～ん♪……あっ、先生だ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_formation_select.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"我是狂猎艺术学院的薄叶律！请多关照啦！","text_original":"ボク、ワイルドハント芸術学院の薄葉リツ！よろしくねっ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_gachaget.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"欸！这个给我吗！？真的吗~？","text_original":"えっ！ボクにくれるの！？ホントに～？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_growup_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"这样一来，多大的石头都能运了呢！","text_original":"これで、どんなおっきい岩でも運べるね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_growup_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"谢谢老师！我会更努力的！","text_original":"ありがと先生！ボク、もっと頑張るね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_growup_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"快看！我变得这~么强了呢~！","text_original":"みてみて！こ～んなに強くなったんだよ～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"社团活动？最喜欢了呢！毕竟能让大家变得幸福！","text_original":"部活？大好きだよ！みんなを幸せにできるもん！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_lobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"在看到石头和粘土的时候，就会想着“必须得把里面的这孩子雕刻出来！”老师你呢？","text_original":"岩や粘土を見るとさ、中に入ってる子を形にしてあげなきゃ！ってなるんだ。先生はどう？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_lobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"只是看的话没法判断有多大呢……老师，可以让我抱一下吗？","text_original":"見ただけじゃ大きさわかんないなぁ……先生、ギューってしてもいい？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_lobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"夏莱的环境真舒服呢~就好像在触摸大理石一样！","text_original":"シャーレって居心地いいね～大理石に触ってるときみたい！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_lobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"老师♪把工作放一放，来和我玩吧~！","text_original":"せ～んせ♪仕事はそのへんにして、ボクと遊んでよ～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_lobby_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"呀吼~老师，在干什么~？","text_original":"やっほ～先生、何してた～？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_login_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"天气不错呢！一起去玩吧老师！","text_original":"いい天気だね！遊びにいこうよ先生！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_login_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊——","text_original":"あー……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_memoriallobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"真凉快啊……","text_original":"すずしー……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_memoriallobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"这里，不错吧？","text_original":"ここ、すごくない？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_memoriallobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"虽说这里好像从很早以前就有的地下蓄水池……","text_original":"むかーしからある地下貯水槽らしいんだけど……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_memoriallobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_memoriallobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"挖个大洞，立上这么多柱子……","text_original":"おっきい穴を掘って、いっぱい柱を立てて……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_memoriallobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_memoriallobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"每根柱子上都有着雕刻……","text_original":"一つ一つに彫刻されてるんだ……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_memoriallobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_memoriallobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"……很漂亮对吧？","text_original":"……きれいでしょ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_memoriallobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_memoriallobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"说什么都想让老师看一下。","text_original":"どうしても先生に見せたかったんだ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_memoriallobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_memoriallobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师，到这边来一下。","text_original":"ね、こっちきて。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_memoriallobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_memoriallobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"来看和我一样的景色吧。","text_original":"ボクと同じ景色、見ようよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_memoriallobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"我说，我能做一个老师的肖像吗？","text_original":"ねね、先生の顔の彫像、作ってもいい？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_relationship_up_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"……老师的皮肤摸起来是这种感觉啊。嗯！应该能复现出来！","text_original":"……これが先生の肌の感触。うん！再現できるかも！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_relationship_up_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"最近，“想雕刻点什么！”的时候，眼前就只会浮现出老师的脸呢~怎么回事呢？","text_original":"最近、なんか彫るぞ！ってとき、先生の顔しか浮かんでこないんだよ～……なんでかなぁ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_relationship_up_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"怎么说呢？看着老师的时候……胸口就会一紧呢。","text_original":"なんかさ？先生を見てると……胸がギュ～ってなるんだよね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_relationship_up_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_season_birthday","category":"lobby","text":"你知道吗？今天是我的生日！我今天想一~直和老师一起玩呢~！","text_original":"ねね！知ってた？今日はボクの誕生日！今日はず～っと、先生と遊びたいな～！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_season_birthday.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_season_birthday_player","category":"lobby","text":"老师，谢谢你来到这个世界！有老师在我身边，真的很幸福呢！","text_original":"先生、生まれてきてくれてありがとね！ボク、先生がいてくれて、ホント幸せなんだ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_season_birthday_player.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_season_halloween","category":"lobby","text":"老师！快点快点~！今天可是糖果和巧克力的争夺战哦！","text_original":"先生！早く早く～！今日はキャンディーとチョコの争奪戦だよ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_season_halloween.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_season_newyear","category":"lobby","text":"Happy new year，老师！我们去看敲钟吧！！……欸？已经结束了吗？","text_original":"ハッピーニューイヤー先生！鐘叩くやつ見に行こ！！……え？もう終わってるの？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_season_newyear.ogg"},{"description":"ch0319_season_xmas","category":"lobby","text":"老师！下雪了！外面全白了哦！正好趁这个机会，一起去做雪雕吧？","text_original":"先生！雪！！お外が真っ白だよ！せっかくだし、一緒に雪で彫刻しない？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/ch0319_season_xmas.ogg"},{"description":"CH0319_Title","category":"lobby","text":"蔚！蓝！档——案！","text_original":"ブルー！アー、カイ、ブッ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%96%84%E5%8F%B6%20%E5%BE%8B/original/jp/CH0319_Title.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[],"voice_kr":[],"gift_data":[{"id":56,"favorability":40},{"id":74,"favorability":60},{"id":78,"favorability":40},{"id":84,"favorability":40},{"id":91,"favorability":40},{"id":162,"favorability":180},{"id":95,"favorability":40},{"id":96,"favorability":40},{"id":142,"favorability":240}],"furniture":[1799],"character_datas":[{"character_id":20050,"dev_name":"CH0319","combat_style":"default","type":"Support","attack_attribute":"Mystic","defensive_attributes":"Special","is_groupc_control":false,"team_position":"BACK","battlefield_position":"SPECIAL","rarity":3,"limited":false,"outdoor_adaptability":"D","indoor_adaptability":"B","street_adaptability":"S","favorite_equipment":0,"weapons":{"name":"移动穿孔机","name_cn":""}}],"info_declare_uuid":"779f0da7-5d80-4abe-a8cf-9ee756f58452","skill_declare_uuid":"b6b42594-2ca1-4c28-be29-8b0e1b45fdbb","supplementary_uuid":"f55cb71a-56da-4fec-a790-1079383b58e1","supplementary_declare_uuid":"22746cf2-7639-4d83-8a66-4fe2a491fea5","created_at":1758355952,"updated_at":1768589040},"message":"OK","success":true,"time":1768764970,"version":"1.0.0-beta.42"}